This file gathers and re-exports the inverse-limit development: the basic constructions, continuity of coordinates, pointwise infima, the T₀ property and the specialization order, injectivity and Proposition 4.1, agreement of the Scott topology with the induced product topology, monotonicity and continuity of the tower embeddings and projections, the expression of a compatible sequence as a supremum of embedded coordinates, Lemma 4.5, the mediating cocone together with its climb, descent, factorization, preservation of directed suprema, and continuity for the inverse-limit topology, and Corollary 4.3.
